?>

In PHP, keywords (e.g. if, 
else, while, 
echo, etc.), classes, functions, 
and user-defined functions are not case-sensitive.

Example
$COLOR is not same as $color:
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>

<?php$color = "red";
echo "My car is " . $color . "<br>";
echo "My house is " . $COLOR . "<br>";
echo "My boat is " . $coLOR . "<br>";
?>

</body>
</html>

